Pacific Squadron @PROJECT_VERSION@ — Linux prebuilt package
==============================================================

Requires x86_64 Linux; SDL3 is bundled, nothing else needs installing
(standard system graphics/audio libraries — X11/Wayland, PulseAudio/ALSA —
are used through SDL).

Run without installing:

    ./bin/pacific-squadron

Install (desktop menu entry + icons + `pacific-squadron` command):

    ./install.sh                  # into ~/.local (no root needed)
    sudo ./install.sh /usr/local  # or into a system prefix

The installer lives at share/pacific-squadron/install.sh in this archive;
from the extracted directory:

    sh share/pacific-squadron/install.sh

Uninstall a ~/.local install:

    sh share/pacific-squadron/install.sh --uninstall
